#: libs/librepcb/core/project/board/drc/boarddesignrulecheckmessages.cpp:1293
msgctxt "DrcMsgDeviceInCourtyard"
msgid "A device is placed within the courtyard of another device, which might cause troubles during assembly of these parts."
msgstr "En enhet placeras på innergården till en annan enhet, vilket kan orsaka problem under monteringen av dessa delar."

#: libs/librepcb/core/project/board/drc/boarddesignrulecheckmessages.cpp:1296
msgctxt "DrcMsgDeviceInCourtyard"
msgid "Either move the devices to increase their clearance or approve this message if you're sure they can be assembled without problems."
msgstr "Antingen flytta enheterna för att öka deras utrymme eller godkänn detta meddelande om du är säker på att de kan monteras utan problem."

